sequenceDiagram
    participant Block as Polygon新区块
    participant RPC as Alchemy RPC
    participant PM as PriceMonitor
    participant PoolMgr as PoolManager
    participant Strategy as Strategy
    participant Executor as Executor
    participant Contract as FlashArbitrage合约
    participant DEX as DEX Routers
    participant Logger as Logger
    
    Block->>RPC: 新区块事件 (block N)
    RPC->>PM: WebSocket推送 blockNumber
    
    Note over PM: 触发价格更新
    PM->>PoolMgr: getPools()
    PoolMgr-->>PM: [pool1, pool2, ...]
    
    par 并行查询储备量
        PM->>RPC: getReserves(pool1)
        PM->>RPC: getReserves(pool2)
        PM->>RPC: getReserves(pool3)
    end
    
    RPC-->>PM: reserves数据
    PM->>PM: 计算价格
    PM->>Strategy: emit('priceUpdate', prices)
    
    Note over Strategy: 寻找套利机会
    Strategy->>Strategy: findTriangularPaths('USDC')
    Strategy->>Strategy: calculateProfit(path, amounts)
    
    alt 发现有利可图的机会
        Strategy->>Strategy: 评估 (利润 > Gas + 阈值)
        Strategy->>Executor: execute(opportunity)
        
        Note over Executor: 预执行检查
        Executor->>RPC: getBalance(wallet)
        Executor->>RPC: getFeeData()
        Executor->>Executor: 最终利润验证
        
        alt 仍然有利可图
            Executor->>Executor: 构建交易calldata
            Executor->>RPC: estimateGas(tx)
            RPC-->>Executor: gasLimit
            
            Executor->>Executor: 签名交易
            Executor->>RPC: sendTransaction(signedTx)
            RPC-->>Executor: txHash
            
            Executor->>Logger: log('交易已发送', txHash)
            
            Note over Contract,DEX: 链上原子化执行
            RPC->>Contract: triangularArbitrage()
            Contract->>DEX: swap1: USDC→WETH
            DEX-->>Contract: WETH amount
            Contract->>DEX: swap2: WETH→MATIC
            DEX-->>Contract: MATIC amount
            Contract->>DEX: swap3: MATIC→USDC
            DEX-->>Contract: USDC amount
            
            Contract->>Contract: require(profit > 0)
            Contract-->>RPC: 交易成功
            
            RPC->>Executor: 交易确认
            Executor->>Logger: log('成功', profit, gasUsed)
            
        else 不再有利可图
            Executor->>Logger: log('机会失效')
        end
        
    else 没有机会
        Strategy->>Logger: log('无套利机会')
    end
